{"id":108026491991900,"name":"Robong: Megabonk [EVOLVE] [CO-OP]","desc":"🧟 ROBONG SURVIVORS — co-op horde survival. Hundreds of zombies, ghosts and goblins at once. Your weapons fire on their own; you choose what they become.\n\n⚔️ SEASON 3 IS LIVE\n\n▸ THE RUN\nEvery level-up is a choice. Max a weapon, pair it with the right perk, and it EVOLVES.\nKill the Guardian and a portal opens: leave and bank your gems (+60%), or stay for the Chaos and risk the whole run.\n\n▸ 5 MAPS\nCastle → City → Desert → Arena → Frozen. Clear one to unlock the next. Each ends in a boss.\n\n▸ WHAT YOU KEEP\n10 classes with a \"Q\" ability · pets to hatch, level and merge · skill tree · clans with quests and research · seasonal leaderboards and titles.\n\n▸ 1-4 PLAYER CO-OP\nRevive your team, vote at the portal, clear maps together.\n\n🔄 UPDATED EVERY WEEK — report bugs on Discord.\n🎁 CODES on our Discord · 👍 LIKE + JOIN THE GROUP for rewards.\n\nzombie survival · horde survival · co op survival · bullet heaven · vampire survivors · megabonk · roguelite · auto battle · boss fight","path":"/game/108026491991900-robong-megabonk","slug":"108026491991900-robong-megabonk","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/28846aa84e34e7d738b7db86fa39970478f462f8590f1eb502ec5722ea4f7043.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0a8e785e7a8cd462fd783313fef7b45f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":44,"visitor":6883668,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-04T20:57:42.295Z","creator":{"name":"GNR Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69d17b4637c8b8c31c1f6301","title":"Auto Loot","game":{"_id":"69d17b4637c8b8c31c1f62fe","gameId":108026491991900,"name":"Robong: Megabonk [EVOLVE] [CO-OP]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"108026491991900-robong-megabonk","path":"/game/108026491991900-robong-megabonk","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.